    "These images were copied out of a test run; there is nothing in the project to delete." : {

    },
    "These keys work while the snapshot tree has focus." : {

    },
    "This test run failed on no snapshot of this project." : {

    },
    "Tolerance" : {

    },
    "Type in the sidebar's filter field (⌘F) to narrow the tree by name. The **Modified** chip under it keeps only snapshots that differ from their committed version, and **Warnings** keeps only suites whose test source could not be found. Each chip appears only when the project has something it would keep. **Edit ▸ Clear Filters**, ⎋ in the field, or the field's **×** puts the whole tree back. To visit the changed snapshots without hiding the rest, use **Snapshot ▸ Next Change** (⌥↓) and **Previous Change** (⌥↑), which open each suite on the way." : {

    },
