    },
    "Warnings" : {

    },
    "What GimDiff has to tell you appears in a strip under the canvas. An explanation — why an action is unavailable — goes away on its own after a few seconds, unless the pointer is on it; a failure stays until you dismiss it. **Window ▸ Recent Messages** keeps the last ten; choose one to copy it." : {

    },
    "What the test run rendered replaces each snapshot's baseline on disk. Images that match no snapshot are left alone." : {

    },
